      "text": "backend-->> It handles all the operations(behind the scene)\n\nProtocols -->> set of rules\n\nhttp-->> hyper text transfer protocol \n\nhttps\n\nFTP--> file transfer protocol (req,file,cb)\n\nSMTP --> simple mail transfer protocol -- to send mails\n\nweb-socket-->   two way commmunication --> like chats video calls etc\n\n\n",
