      "text": "Expres --> framework for nodejs\n\nhe did not know how to catch text data in request\n\nso we use a middleware --> express.json\n\n\nrequest ke andar bhut kuc aati hai\n\n1.body-> (frontend se bheja hua data)\n2.query->search(extra data in path)\n3.params->dynamic url\n4.file/files->ftp",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Expres --> framework for nodejs\n\nhe did not know how to catch text data in request\n\nso we use a middleware --> express.json\n\n\nrequest ke andar bhut kuc aati hai\n\n1.body-> (frontend se bheja hua data)\n2.query->search(extra data in path)\n3.params->dynamic url\n4.file/files->ftp",
